---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="For the Brides | Free Wedding Hashtag Studio | Four Dogs Entertainment" description="Create your wedding hashtag for free with the Four Dogs Wedding Hashtag Studio. Choose romantic, funny, clever puns, classic, or party vibes. Save favorites and download a shareable card.">
<div class="brides">
  <section class="brides-hero">
    <div class="brides-shell brides-hero-grid">
      <div class="brides-hero-copy">
        <div class="brides-kicker">FOUR DOGS ENTERTAINMENT PRESENTS &nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; FOR THE BRIDES</div>
        <h1>The perfect match.<br><em>The perfect</em> <span>hashtag.</span></h1>
        <p class="brides-lead">Your love story deserves more than #JustMarried. Tell us your names, pick your personality, and discover something worth sharing.</p>
        <div class="brides-tags"><span>♡ ROMANTIC</span><span>✳ CLEVER</span><span>✦ COMPLETELY YOURS</span></div>
        <a class="brides-hero-cta" href="#brides-studio">FIND YOUR HASHTAG <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="brides-hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="brides-art-orbit"></span><div class="brides-art-text">it's a<br><i>love</i><br>story<span>.</span></div><small>#HappilyEverAfter</small><div class="brides-art-seal">MADE WITH<br>LOVE & PUNS</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="brides-ribbon" aria-hidden="true">LOVE IS IN THE AIR &nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; SO ARE THE GOOD PUNS &nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; SOMETHING BORROWED, SOMETHING #BRILLIANT &nbsp; ✳</div>
  <section class="brides-studio brides-shell" id="brides-studio">
    <div class="brides-section-label">01 / MAKE IT YOURS</div>
    <h2>Tell us about <em>your two.</em></h2>
    <p class="brides-muted">No account, no email, no strings attached. Just you, your people, and a little wordplay.</p>
    <div class="brides-studio-layout">
      <form id="brides-form" class="brides-form" novalidate>
        <div class="brides-form-title"><div class="brides-symbol">♡</div><div><strong>Start your love story</strong><small>The names behind the hashtag.</small></div></div>
        <div class="brides-fields">
          <label>FIRST NAME <span>*</span><input id="brides-first" name="first" maxlength="28" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="e.g. Taylor" required></label>
          <label>SECOND NAME <span>*</span><input id="brides-second" name="second" maxlength="28" placeholder="e.g. Jordan" required></label>
          <label>FUTURE / SHARED LAST NAME <small>OPTIONAL</small><input id="brides-last" name="last" maxlength="32" placeholder="e.g. Moore"></label>
          <label>WEDDING YEAR <small>OPTIONAL</small><select id="brides-year" name="year"><option value="">No year</option></select></label>
        </div>
        <div class="brides-form-rule"><span>✳</span></div>
        <fieldset class="brides-vibes"><legend>WHAT'S YOUR WEDDING VIBE?</legend><p>Choose the style that feels most like you.</p>
          <div class="brides-vibe-grid">
            <label><input type="radio" name="vibe" value="mix" checked><span>✦</span><strong>Surprise Me</strong><small>A little of everything</small></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="vibe" value="romantic"><span>♡</span><strong>Romantic</strong><small>Sweet & sentimental</small></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="vibe" value="funny"><span>☺</span><strong>Funny</strong><small>Goofy in a good way</small></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="vibe" value="punny"><span>✳</span><strong>Pun Intended</strong><small>A clever little twist</small></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="vibe" value="elegant"><span>✧</span><strong>Classic & Chic</strong><small>Timeless and stylish</small></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="vibe" value="party"><span>♫</span><strong>Party Mode</strong><small>Bring the dance floor</small></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <p id="brides-error" class="brides-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <button class="brides-primary" type="submit">MAKE OUR HASHTAGS <span>↗</span></button>
        <p class="brides-form-foot">100% FREE &nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; NO SIGNUP &nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; UNLIMITED IDEAS</p>
      </form>
      <aside class="brides-note"><div class="brides-note-inner"><div class="brides-section-label">A LITTLE NOTE FROM US &nbsp; ✧</div><blockquote>“The best weddings feel like <em>you.</em> Your hashtag should, too.”</blockquote><hr><p>Whether you're a hopeless romantic, pun enthusiast, or first one on the dance floor, there's a vibe for that.</p><i>Love, Four Dogs ♡</i></div><div class="brides-note-footer">GOOD VIBES. GREAT HASHTAGS. ✳</div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="brides-results brides-shell" id="brides-results" hidden aria-live="polite">
    <div class="brides-results-head"><div><div class="brides-section-label">02 / THE BIG REVEAL</div><h2>Hashtags worth <em>falling for.</em></h2><p class="brides-muted">Heart the ones you love. Tap any hashtag to copy it.</p></div><button class="brides-text-btn" id="brides-edit" type="button">← EDIT DETAILS</button></div>
    <div class="brides-results-toolbar"><span id="brides-result-count">12 fresh ideas</span><div><button type="button" id="brides-more" class="brides-outline">✳ GET MORE IDEAS</button><button type="button" id="brides-copy-all" class="brides-outline">COPY ALL ↗</button></div></div>
    <div class="brides-results-grid" id="brides-results-grid"></div>
    <div class="brides-favorites">
      <div class="brides-section-label">03 / THE SHORTLIST</div><h3>The ones you <em>love.</em></h3>
      <p id="brides-empty" class="brides-muted">Tap a heart above to save the hashtags you love.</p>
      <div id="brides-favorites-list" class="brides-fav-list"></div>
      <button id="brides-copy-faves" type="button" class="brides-outline" disabled>COPY MY FAVORITES ↗</button>
      <button id="brides-share-faves" type="button" class="brides-outline" disabled>SHARE FAVORITES ↗</button>
    </div>
    <div class="brides-card-studio">
      <div><div class="brides-section-label">04 / SHOW IT OFF</div><h3>A hashtag worth <em>sharing.</em></h3><p>Create a high-resolution graphic for your friends, wedding group chat, or Facebook group.</p>
      <label>YOUR HASHTAG<select id="brides-card-tag"></select></label>
      <label>CARD STYLE<select id="brides-card-style"><option value="midnight">Midnight & Champagne</option><option value="ivory">Modern Ivory</option><option value="cyan">Electric Love</option></select></label>
      <button type="button" id="brides-download" class="brides-primary">DOWNLOAD SHARE CARD <span>↓</span></button><small>Free, high-resolution PNG. No watermark covering your hashtag.</small></div>
      <div id="brides-card-preview" class="brides-card-preview midnight"><div>THE WEDDING OF</div><strong id="brides-preview-names">Taylor & Jordan</strong><span id="brides-preview-tag">#TaylorAndJordanForever</span><small>LOVE • LAUGHTER • HAPPILY EVER AFTER</small><footer>FOUR DOGS ENTERTAINMENT</footer></div>
    </div>
    <div class="brides-roast"><div><span class="brides-section-label">A LITTLE EXTRA FUN</span><h3>Roast our hashtag.</h3><p>We'll give your chosen hashtag a playful, wedding-friendly verdict.</p><select id="brides-roast-tag" aria-label="Hashtag to rate"></select><button class="brides-outline" type="button" id="brides-roast-button">RATE OUR HASHTAG ✳</button></div><div id="brides-roast-output" class="brides-roast-output" aria-live="polite">Your hashtag enters the group chat. What happens next?</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="brides-convert"><div class="brides-shell brides-convert-grid"><div><div class="brides-section-label">THE NEXT CHAPTER</div><h2>Hashtag? <em>Check.</em><br>Unforgettable reception? <em>We got you.</em></h2><p>You bring the love story. We'll bring the music, hosting, and a dance floor nobody wants to leave. Weddings across South Carolina, North Carolina, and Georgia.</p><a class="brides-primary brides-book" href="/booking/?service=Wedding%20DJ%20%2F%20Entertainment">LET'S PLAN YOUR WEDDING ↗</a></div><div class="brides-convert-orbit" aria-hidden="true">GOOD LOVE.<br>GREAT PARTY.<br>FOUR DOGS.</div></div></section>
  <p id="brides-toast" class="brides-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</div>
</Base>
<style is:global>
